# LAST RULES WIN: the registry service's public-catalog seed must ship in the image —
# deep-dive 2026-06-11 found the blanket `dist` exclusion silently emptied the deployed
# catalog (registry_local_service BUNDLE_DIR). Runtime dist/* stays ignored; the design
# bundle (incl. its images) is re-included here AFTER the *.png/*.jpg excludes.
!dist/sites/openharness-design
!dist/sites/openharness-design/**
